    User->>Browser: Select file
    Browser->>Hook: selectFile resets prior result
    User->>Browser: Analyze MP3
    Browser->>Hook: analyze on form submit
    alt Missing file or file exceeds 20 MiB
        Hook-->>Browser: Readable local error
        Browser-->>User: Display error
    else File passes local validation
        Hook->>Hook: Admit one request, set pending and start deadline
        Hook-->>Browser: Disable pending controls
        Hook->>Service: Await analysis of selected File with abort signal
        Service->>Frontend: Await raw POST /file-upload via published loopback port
        alt Response is available
            alt Mapped NGINX upload/proxy failure
                Frontend-->>Service: 413, 502 or 504 status and JSON
            else Unmapped ingress response
                Frontend-->>Service: Status and body without a JSON guarantee
            else Request forwarded over HTTP/1.1 without buffering or retry
                Frontend->>API: Forward raw bytes to api:3000 on Compose network
                API->>API: Raw path/method bridge, then ordered Fastify admission
                API->>API: Custom stream parser bounds actual bytes and deadlines
                alt Invalid request, over limit, busy or timed out
                    API-->>Frontend: Contracted error status and JSON
                else Complete nonempty body within 20 MiB
                    API->>Parser: POST route counts complete physical MPEG-1 Layer III frames
                    alt Valid supported file
                        Parser-->>API: Positive count including metadata-bearing frames
                        API-->>Frontend: 200 JSON with frameCount
                    else Invalid or unsupported structure
                        Parser-->>API: Typed failure
                        API-->>Frontend: 400 or 415 JSON
                    end
                end
                Frontend-->>Service: Preserve API status and JSON
            end
            Service->>Service: Attempt to read response JSON
            alt JSON is readable
                Service->>Service: Validate exact success or readable API error
                Service-->>Hook: Typed count or readable error
            else JSON is unreadable
                Service-->>Hook: Readable response parse error
            end
        else Fetch rejects, including abort
            Service--xHook: Propagate rejected fetch
            Hook->>Hook: Catch timeout or connection failure
        end
        alt Request generation is still current
            Hook-->>Browser: Render result and restore controls
            Browser-->>User: Count or readable error#59; allow retry
        else Superseded selection or unmounted page
            Hook->>Hook: Ignore stale outcome
        end
        Hook->>Hook: Finally clear deadline#59; clear active slot only if current
    end
    Note over Hook,Service: Selection and unmount abort requests#59; stale outcomes never update the page
    Note over Hook,API: Abort or network failure is not partial success
